Option Default Description <code>setCheckLogicalMessageCriteria(boolean)</code> <code>true</code> Enables/disables logical message criteria validation. Some translations check the message subtype (e.g., NEW vs CANC). Also applies to MX→MT. <code>setCheckPreconditions(boolean)</code> <code>true</code> Enables/disables content precondition checks before translation. Also applies to MX→MT. <pre><code>// Skip precondition checks (use with caution)
config.setCheckPreconditions(false);
</code></pre>

Option Default Description <code>setUseStructuredAddressesIfPossible(boolean)</code> <code>true</code> When true, maps fields 50F and 59F to MX structured address format (Country, TownName, StreetName). When false, maps to address lines. <pre><code>// Use address lines instead of structured addresses
config.setUseStructuredAddressesIfPossible(false);
</code></pre>

Option Default Description <code>setClearingSystemMemberIdToBic(ClearingSystemMemberIdToBic)</code> <code>null</code> Custom function to resolve clearing system member IDs to BIC codes. <pre><code>config.setClearingSystemMemberIdToBic((clearingSystem, memberId) -&gt; {
    // Custom lookup logic
    return lookupBic(clearingSystem, memberId);
});
</code></pre> <p>Configuration inheritance</p> <p>When using the factory pattern with <code>TranslatorFactoryProvider</code>, some configuration options are automatically inherited from the <code>TranslatorFactoryConfiguration</code> (such as AppHdrType and business service mappings).</p>

